Create a new Maven project
Add maven dependencies like - Cucumber java | testNG | Selenium java
Create a feature folder under src/tes/resources
under feature folder create a new feature file onboarding.feature 
Download cucumber plugin from eclipse marketplace
create a feature file and add contexts
Try to run the feature file
Add Step Definitions /Glue code under src/test/java package.

